<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal current account deficit jumped in '96.</title>
<headline>Portugal current account deficit jumped in '96.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's current account deficit rose to 848.4 billion escudos in 1996 from 605.1 billion in 1995, the Bank of Portugal said in its latest monthly report.  </p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
